@startuml
[*] --> Draft : batch created by treasurer

Draft --> PendingApproval : submit for approval
Draft --> Draft : [correction needed]

PendingApproval --> TreasurerApproved : treasurer signs off
PendingApproval --> Draft : [treasurer rejects]

TreasurerApproved --> Finalised : committee member co-signs
TreasurerApproved --> Draft : [committee rejects]

Finalised --> Paid : slips distributed to members
Finalised --> [*]

Paid --> [*]

note right of TreasurerApproved
  Business rule: BOTH treasurer
  AND committee member must
  approve before finalisation.
  (Two-person rule, SRS §1.1)
end note
@enduml   